 return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-009 | Larchmont Grounds Ltd"}],"42":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Grounds maintenance: agreement | Page 42 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Standard rate per hour £42.00; Senior rate per hour £68.00; Out-of-hours call-out per call £145.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-009-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are reviewed once a year in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-009 | Larchmont Grounds Ltd"}],"45":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Grounds maintenance: agreement | Page 45 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges shall be reviewed on 1 April each year by reference to the C