ely by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Routes to early exit","text":"Because neither party may terminate for convenience, the Council's routes to early exit are those in clauses 30.2 to 30.4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.6","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination does not affect any right that has accrued before the termination date."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-014 | Stonemere Energy Supply Ltd"}],"31":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Electricity and gas supply: agreement | Page 31 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"31","text":"Expiry, renewal and notice"},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.1","title":"Expiry and renewal","text":"The Council shall give the Supplier not less than three (3) months' written notice before the end of the Initial Term if it wishes to exercise an extension option or to let this Agreement expire.","clauseRef":"Clause 31.1","extractionIds":["X-C-014-noticePeriod","X-C-014-autoRenewal"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.2","title":"Serving notice","text":"Notice under clause 31.1 must be in writing and given in accordance with clause 45 (Notices)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.3","title":"Expiry without notice","text":"If the Council gives no notice, this Agreement expires on the Expiry Date and the Supplier has no right to payment for Services after that date unless a Variation has been agreed under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.4","title":"Last date for notice","text":"For the Initial Term, the last date on which the Council may give notice under clause 31.1 is 30 June 2027."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.5","title":"Withdrawing a notice","text":"The Council may withdraw a notice to extend only with the Supplier's written agreement."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.6","title":"Register","text":"The Council shall record the last date for notice in its contracts register."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-014 | Stonemere Energy Supply Ltd"}],"32":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Electricity and gas supply: agreement | Page 32 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"33","text":"Consequences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"No termination payment is due from the Council except for Charges properly incurred up to the termination date.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-014-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.6","title":"Staff","text":"Where staff transfer on exit, the parties shall comply with the provisions in Schedule 10 (Staff transfer)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-014 | Stonemere Energy Supply Ltd"}],"42":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Electricity and gas supply: agreement | Page 42 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Standard rate per hour £42.00; Senior rate per hour £68.00; Out-of-hours call-out per call £145.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-014-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are fixed for the Initial Term."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"clause","num":"5","title":"Travel","text":"The Council shall not be charged for travel time or mobilisation unless Table 1 says so."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-014 | Stonemere Energy Supply Ltd"}],"45":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Electricity and gas supply: agreement | Page 45 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges are fixed for the Initial Term and are not subject to indexation.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-014-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Requests to change","text":"Any request to change the Charges during the Initial Term must follow clause 41 (Variation)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No change for the Supplier's costs","text":"Nothing in this Schedule 4 permits an increase because of changes in the Supplier's own costs, including labour, plant, materials and fuel."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Agreement in writing","text":"The Council shall not be required to pay an increase in the Charges that has not been agreed in writing under clause 41."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-014 | Stonemere Energy Supply Ltd"}],"50":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Electricity and gas supply: agreement | Page 50 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"No service credit regime applies under this Agreement.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-014-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Other remedies","text":"The Council's remedies for poor performance are set out in clause 22 (Performance management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.3","title":"Repeated failure","text":"Repeated failure to meet a Key Performance Indicator is a Performance Failure and shall be dealt with under clause 22."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-014 | Stonemere Energy Supply Ltd"}]}},"DOC-C-015":{"id":"DOC-C-015","contractId":"C-015","title":"Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement","pageCount":54,"isIllustrative":true,"pages":{"7":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 7 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contract Particulars"},{"kind":"item","num":"1","text":"Contracting Authority: Marchbank Borough Council."},{"kind":"item","num":"2","text":"Supplier: Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd, company number 90011918."},{"kind":"item","num":"3","text":"Services: Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance."},{"kind":"item","num":"4","text":"Commencement Date: 1 November 2022.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 4","extractionIds":["X-C-015-startDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"5","text":"Expiry Date of the Initial Term: 31 October 2027.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 5","extractionIds":["X-C-015-endDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"6","text":"Procurement route: Open procedure."},{"kind":"item","num":"7","text":"Governing law: the law of England and Wales."},{"kind":"item","num":"8","text":"Estimated annual value of the Services: £780,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 8","extractionIds":["X-C-015-estimatedAnnualValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"9","text":"Estimated total value over the Initial Term: £3,900,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 9","extractionIds":["X-C-015-awardedTotalValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"10","text":"Maximum Contract Value: see clause 14.3. The estimated values in items 8 and 9 are provided for budgeting purposes only and do not oblige the Council to purchase any minimum volume of Services."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"13":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 13 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"2","text":"Term and extension"},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Term","text":"This Agreement starts on the Commencement Date and continues until the Expiry Date, unless it ends earlier under clause 30 or is extended under this clause 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Extension","text":"The Council may, by giving the Supplier written notice, extend the Term on 1 occasion by up to 12 months each time (each an Extension Period).","clauseRef":"Clause 2.2","extractionIds":["X-C-015-extensions"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"Terms of an extension","text":"Each Extension Period is on the terms of this Agreement. The Charges for an Extension Period are reviewed only in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Decision","text":"The decision to extend is the Council's alone. The Supplier may not refuse an extension that the Council has validly exercised."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.5","title":"Longest possible Term","text":"The Term, including every Extension Period, cannot run beyond 31 October 2028."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"20":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 20 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"12","text":"Invoicing and payment"},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.1","title":"Invoices","text":"The Supplier shall invoice the Council monthly in arrears for Services properly performed."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.2","title":"Valid invoice","text":"A valid invoice shall quote the Council's purchase order number and the contract reference C-015, and shall be addressed to the Council's Accounts Payable team."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.3","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT. The Council shall pay VAT at the rate in force on receipt of a valid VAT invoice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.4","title":"Payment","text":"The Council shall pay each undisputed invoice within 30 days of receipt.","clauseRef":"Clause 12.4","extractionIds":["X-C-015-paymentTerms"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.5","title":"Late payment","text":"Interest on late payment accrues under the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1998."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"23":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 23 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"14","text":"Charges and Maximum Contract Value"},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.1","title":"Charges","text":"The Council shall pay the Charges set out in Schedule 2 for Services properly performed in accordance with this Agreement."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.2","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT and are the only sums payable by the Council for the Services."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.3","title":"Maximum Contract Value","text":"The Council's liability to pay the Charges under this Agreement shall not exceed £4,300,000 in aggregate (the Maximum Contract Value) unless increased by a Variation under clause 41.","clauseRef":"Clause 14.3","extractionIds":["X-C-015-maximumValue"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.4","title":"Alert at 80%","text":"The Supplier shall notify the Council in writing when cumulative Charges reach eighty per cent (80%) of the Maximum Contract Value, being £3,440,000."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.5","title":"Services beyond the limit","text":"The Supplier shall not be obliged to perform Services that would cause the Maximum Contract Value to be exceeded unless a Variation has been agreed in writing under clause 41."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"31":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 31 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"30","text":"Termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.1","title":"Termination for convenience","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement for convenience at any time by giving the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice.","clauseRef":"Clause 30.1","extractionIds":["X-C-015-terminationForConvenience"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.2","title":"Termination for breach","text":"Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice if the other commits a material breach that is not remedied within thirty (30) days of a notice requiring it to be remedied."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.3","title":"Insolvency","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement immediately by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Sums payable","text":"Where the Council terminates under clause 30.1, the only sums payable are those set out in clause 33.2."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"32":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 32 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"31","text":"Expiry, renewal and notice"},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.1","title":"Expiry and renewal","text":"The Council shall give the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice before the end of the Initial Term if it wishes to exercise an extension option or to let this Agreement expire.","clauseRef":"Clause 31.1","extractionIds":["X-C-015-noticePeriod","X-C-015-autoRenewal"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.2","title":"Serving notice","text":"Notice under clause 31.1 must be in writing and given in accordance with clause 45 (Notices)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.3","title":"Expiry without notice","text":"If the Council gives no notice, this Agreement expires on the Expiry Date and the Supplier has no right to payment for Services after that date unless a Variation has been agreed under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.4","title":"Last date for notice","text":"For the Initial Term, the last date on which the Council may give notice under clause 31.1 is 30 April 2027."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.5","title":"Withdrawing a notice","text":"The Council may withdraw a notice to extend only with the Supplier's written agreement."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"33":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 33 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"33","text":"Consequences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"On early termination the Council shall pay: Early termination charge equal to 50% of remaining lease rentals.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-015-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"43":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 43 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Standard rate per hour £42.00; Senior rate per hour £68.00; Out-of-hours call-out per call £145.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-015-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are reviewed once a year in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"46":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 46 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges shall be reviewed on 1 November each year by reference to the Consumer Prices Index (CPI) for the preceding September, provided that no increase shall exceed 3.0% in any Contract Year.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-015-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Evidence","text":"The Supplier shall send the Council the index figures it has used, with its calculation, at least thirty (30) days before the review date."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No retrospective increase","text":"A change takes effect from the review date only and does not apply retrospectively."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}],"51":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Fleet vehicle lease and maintenance: agreement | Page 51 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"No service credit regime applies under this Agreement.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-015-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Other remedies","text":"The Council's remedies for poor performance are set out in clause 22 (Performance management)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-015 | Rookhope Fleet Solutions Ltd"}]}},"DOC-C-016":{"id":"DOC-C-016","contractId":"C-016","title":"Parking enforcement services: agreement","pageCount":58,"isIllustrative":true,"pages":{"3":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 3 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contract Particulars"},{"kind":"item","num":"1","text":"Contracting Authority: Marchbank Borough Council."},{"kind":"item","num":"2","text":"Supplier: Veridene Parking Services Ltd, company number 90012055."},{"kind":"item","num":"3","text":"Services: Parking enforcement services."},{"kind":"item","num":"4","text":"Commencement Date: 1 January 2020.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 4","extractionIds":["X-C-016-startDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"5","text":"Expiry Date of the Initial Term: 31 December 2026.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 5","extractionIds":["X-C-016-endDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"6","text":"Procurement route: Open procedure."},{"kind":"item","num":"7","text":"Governing law: the law of England and Wales."},{"kind":"item","num":"8","text":"Estimated annual value of the Services: £950,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 8","extractionIds":["X-C-016-estimatedAnnualValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"9","text":"Estimated total value over the Initial Term: £6,650,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 9","extractionIds":["X-C-016-awardedTotalValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"10","text":"No maximum contract value is stated. The estimated total value above is the only value limit in the Agreement.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 10","extractionIds":["X-C-016-maximumValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"11","text":"The estimated values in items 8 and 9 are provided for budgeting purposes only and do not oblige the Council to purchase any minimum volume of Services."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"9":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 9 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"2","text":"Term and extension"},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Term","text":"This Agreement starts on the Commencement Date and continues until the Expiry Date, unless it ends earlier under clause 30 or is extended under this clause 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Extension","text":"There is no right to extend the Term beyond the Expiry Date.","clauseRef":"Clause 2.2","extractionIds":["X-C-016-extensions"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"Re-procurement","text":"The Council shall decide before the notice date in clause 31.1 whether to procure a replacement for the Services."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"No implied extension","text":"Nothing in this Agreement entitles the Supplier to carry out Services, or to be paid for them, after the Expiry Date unless the parties agree a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.5","title":"Further contracts","text":"Any further contract for the Services shall be awarded in accordance with the Council's Contract Procedure Rules."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.6","title":"Interpretation","text":"References to the Term are to the period from the Commencement Date to the Expiry Date."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"16":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 16 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"12","text":"Invoicing and payment"},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.1","title":"Invoices","text":"The Supplier shall invoice the Council monthly in arrears for Services properly performed."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.2","title":"Valid invoice","text":"A valid invoice shall quote the Council's purchase order number and the contract reference C-016, and shall be addressed to the Council's Accounts Payable team."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.3","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT. The Council shall pay VAT at the rate in force on receipt of a valid VAT invoice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.4","title":"Payment","text":"The Council shall pay each undisputed invoice within 30 days of receipt.","clauseRef":"Clause 12.4","extractionIds":["X-C-016-paymentTerms"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.5","title":"Late payment","text":"Interest on late payment accrues under the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1998."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.6","title":"Disputed invoices","text":"If the Council disputes part of an invoice it shall pay the undisputed part and tell the Supplier within ten (10) days why it disputes the rest."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"27":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 27 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"30","text":"Termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.1","title":"Termination for convenience","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement for convenience at any time by giving the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice.","clauseRef":"Clause 30.1","extractionIds":["X-C-016-terminationForConvenience"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.2","title":"Termination for breach","text":"Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice if the other commits a material breach that is not remedied within thirty (30) days of a notice requiring it to be remedied."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.3","title":"Insolvency","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement immediately by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Sums payable","text":"Where the Council terminates under clause 30.1, the only sums payable are those set out in clause 33.2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.6","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination does not affect any right that has accrued before the termination date."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"28":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 28 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"31","text":"Expiry, renewal and notice"},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.1","title":"Expiry and renewal","text":"Unless the Council gives the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice before the end of the Initial Term, this Agreement shall renew automatically for a further period of 12 months.","clauseRef":"Clause 31.1","extractionIds":["X-C-016-noticePeriod","X-C-016-autoRenewal"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.2","title":"Serving notice","text":"Notice under clause 31.1 must be in writing and given in accordance with clause 45 (Notices)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.3","title":"Renewal terms","text":"Where this Agreement renews under clause 31.1, the renewed term is on the same terms and the Charges are reviewed in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.4","title":"Last date for notice","text":"For the Initial Term, the last date on which the Council may give notice under clause 31.1 is 30 June 2026."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.5","title":"No reasons needed","text":"The Council may give notice under clause 31.1 without giving reasons and without liability to pay compensation to the Supplier."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.6","title":"Register","text":"The Council shall record the last date for notice in its contracts register."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"29":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 29 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"33","text":"Consequences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"No termination payment is due from the Council except for Charges properly incurred up to the termination date.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-016-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.6","title":"Staff","text":"Where staff transfer on exit, the parties shall comply with the provisions in Schedule 10 (Staff transfer)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"39":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 39 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Standard rate per hour £42.00; Senior rate per hour £68.00; Out-of-hours call-out per call £145.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-016-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are reviewed once a year in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"clause","num":"5","title":"Travel","text":"The Council shall not be charged for travel time or mobilisation unless Table 1 says so."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"42":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 42 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges shall be reviewed on 1 January each year by reference to the Consumer Prices Index (CPI) for the preceding September, provided that no increase shall exceed 3.0% in any Contract Year.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-016-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Evidence","text":"The Supplier shall send the Council the index figures it has used, with its calculation, at least thirty (30) days before the review date."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No retrospective increase","text":"A change takes effect from the review date only and does not apply retrospectively."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Cap applies","text":"If the index figure is higher than the limit in paragraph 2.1, the limit applies."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}],"47":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Parking enforcement services: agreement | Page 47 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"If the Supplier fails to meet a Key Performance Indicator in a month, the Council may deduct a Service Credit of 2% of the monthly Charges for each failure, up to a maximum of 10% of the monthly Charges.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-016-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Not a penalty","text":"Service Credits are a price adjustment that reflects the reduced value of the Services. They are not a penalty."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.3","title":"Deduction","text":"Service Credits shall be deducted from the next invoice, or paid by the Supplier within thirty (30) days if no further invoice is due."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-016 | Veridene Parking Services Ltd"}]}},"DOC-C-017":{"id":"DOC-C-017","contractId":"C-017","title":"Mobile voice and data: agreement","pageCoun