ed on 1 March each year by reference to the Retail Prices Index (RPI) for the preceding September, provided that no increase shall exceed 3.5% in any Contract Year.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-018-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Evidence","text":"The Supplier shall send the Council the index figures it has used, with its calculation, at least thirty (30) days before the review date."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No retrospective increase","text":"A change takes effect from the review date only and does not apply retrospectively."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Cap applies","text":"If the index figure is higher than the limit in paragraph 2.1, the limit applies."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-018 | Aldwick Cleansing Ltd"}],"49":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Street cleansing: agreement | Page 49 of 66"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"If the Supplier fails to meet a Key Performance Indicator in a month, the Council may deduct a Service Credit of 2% of the monthly Charges for each failure, up to a maximum of 10% of the monthly Charges.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-018-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Not a penalty","text":"Service Credits are a price adjustment that reflects the reduced value of the Services. They are not a penalty."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.3","title":"Deduction","text":"Service Credits shall be deducted from the next invoice, or paid by the Supplier within thirty (30) days if no further invoice is due."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-018 | Aldwick Cleansing Ltd"}]}},"DOC-C-019":{"id":"DOC-C-019","contractId":"C-019","title":"Library management system: agreement","pageCount":70,"isIllustrative":true,"pages":{"6":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Library management system: agreement | Page 6 of 70"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contract Particulars"},{"kind":"item","num":"1","text":"Contracting Authority: Marchbank Borough Council."},{"kind":"item","num":"2","text":"Supplier: Ivelet Library Systems Ltd, company number 90012466."},{"kind":"item","num":"3","text":"Services: Library management system."},{"kind":"item","num":"4","text":"Commencement Date: 1 April 2025.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 4","extractionIds":["X-C-019-startDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"5","text":"Expiry Date of the Initial Term: 31 March 2030.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 5","extractionIds":["X-C-019-endDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"6","text":"Procurement route: Framework call-off."},{"kind":"item","num":"7","text":"Governing law: the law of England and Wales."},{"kind":"item","num":"8","text":"Estimated annual value of the Services: £180,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 8","extractionIds":["X-C-019-estimatedAnnualValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"9","text":"Estimated total value over the Initial Term: £900,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 9","extractionIds":["X-C-019-awardedTotalValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"10","text":"No maximum contract value is stated. The estimated total value above is the only value limit in the Agreement.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 10","extractionIds":["X-C-019-maximumValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"11","text":"The estimated values in items 8 and 9 are provided for budgeting purposes only and do not oblige the Council to purchase any minimum volume of Services."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-019 | Ivelet Library Systems Ltd"}],"12":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Library management system: agreement | Page 12 of 70"},{"kind":"heading","num":"2","text":"Term and extension"},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Term","text":"This Agreement starts on the Commencement Date and continues until the Expiry Date, unless it ends earlier under clause 30 or is extended under this clause 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Extension","text":"The Council may, by giving the Supplier written notice, extend the Term on 1 occasion by up to 24 months each time (each an Extension Period).","clauseRef":"Clause 2.2","extractionIds":["X-C-019-extensions"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"Terms of an extension","text":"Each Extension Period is on the terms of this Agreement. The Charges for an Extension Period are reviewed only in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Decision","text":"The decision to extend is the Council's alone. The Supplier may not refuse an extension that the Council has validly exercised."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.5","title":"Longest possible Term","text":"The Term, including every Extension Period, cannot run beyond 31 March 2032."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-019 | Ivelet Library Systems Ltd"}],"19":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Library management system: agreement | Page 19 of 70"},{"kind":"heading","num":"12","text":"Invoicing and payment"},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.1","title":"Invoices","text":"The Supplier shall invoice the Council quarterly in arrears for Services properly performed."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.2","title":"Valid invoice","text":"A valid invoice shall quote the Council's purchase order number and the contract reference C-019, and shall be addressed to the Council's Accounts Payable team."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.3","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT. The Council shall pay VAT at the rate in force on receipt of a valid VAT invoice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.4","title":"Payment","text":"The Council shall pay each undisputed invoice within 30 days of receipt.","clauseRef":"Clause 12.4","extractionIds":["X-C-019-paymentTerms"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.5","title":"Late payment","text":"Interest on late payment accrues under the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1998."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-019 | Ivelet Library Systems Ltd"}],"30":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Library management system: agreement | Page 30 of 70"},{"kind":"heading","num":"30","text":"Termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.1","title":"Termination for convenience","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement for convenience at any time by giving the Supplier not less than three (3) months' written notice.","clauseRef":"Clause 30.1","extractionIds":["X-C-019-terminationForConvenience"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.2","title":"Termination for breach","text":"Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice if the other commits a material breach that is not remedied within thirty (30) days of a notice requiring it to be remedied."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.3","title":"Insolvency","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement immediately by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Sums payable","text":"Where the Council terminates under clause 30.1, the only sums payable are those set out in clause 33.2."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-019 | Ivele