ences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"No termination payment is due from the Council except for Charges properly incurred up to the termination date.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-020-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.6","title":"Staff","text":"Where staff transfer on exit, the parties shall comply with the provisions in Schedule 10 (Staff transfer)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-020 | Norland Cleaning Services Ltd"}],"43":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Civic buildings cleaning: agreement | Page 43 of 74"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Operative per hour £19.40; Supervisor per hour £27.85; Out-of-hours call-out per call £145.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-020-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are reviewed once a year in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"clause","num":"5","title":"Travel","text":"The Council shall not be charged for travel time or mobilisation unless Table 1 says so."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-020 | Norland Cleaning Services Ltd"}],"46":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Civic buildings cleaning: agreement | Page 46 of 74"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges shall be reviewed on 1 June each year by reference to the Consumer Prices Index (CPI) for the preceding September, provided that no increase shall exceed 3.0% in any Contract Year.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-020-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Evidence","text":"The Supplier shall send the Council the index figures it has used, with its calculation, at least thirty (30) days before the review date."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No retrospective increase","text":"A change takes effect from the review date only and does not apply retrospectively."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Cap applies","text":"If the index figure is higher than the limit in paragraph 2.1, the limit applies."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-020 | Norland Cleaning Services Ltd"}],"51":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Civic buildings cleaning: agreement | Page 51 of 74"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"If the Supplier fails to meet a Key Performance Indicator in a month, the Council may deduct a Service Credit of 2% of the monthly Charges for each failure, up to a maximum of 10% of the monthly Charges.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-020-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Not a penalty","text":"Service Credits are a price adjustment that reflects the reduced value of the Services. They are not a penalty."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.3","title":"Deduction","text":"Service Credits shall be deducted from the next invoice, or paid by the Supplier within thirty (30) days if no further invoice is due."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-020 | Norland Cleaning Services Ltd"}]}},"DOC-C-021":{"id":"DOC-C-021","contractId":"C-021","title":"Insurance brokerage: agreement","pageCount":78,"isIllustrative":true,"pages":{"3":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 3 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contract Particulars"},{"kind":"item","num":"1","text":"Contracting Authority: Marchbank Borough Council."},{"kind":"item","num":"2","text":"Supplier: Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd, company number 90012740."},{"kind":"item","num":"3","text":"Services: Insurance brokerage."},{"kind":"item","num":"4","text":"Commencement Date: 1 April 2023.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 4","extractionIds":["X-C-021-startDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"5","text":"Expiry Date of the Initial Term: 31 March 2030.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 5","extractionIds":["X-C-021-endDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"6","text":"Procurement route: Open procedure."},{"kind":"item","num":"7","text":"Governing law: the law of England and Wales."},{"kind":"item","num":"8","text":"Estimated annual value of the Services: £340,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 8","extractionIds":["X-C-021-estimatedAnnualValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"9","text":"Estimated total value over the Initial Term: £2,380,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 9","extractionIds":["X-C-021-awardedTotalValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"10","text":"No maximum contract value is stated. The estimated total value above is the only value limit in the Agreement.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 10","extractionIds":["X-C-021-maximumValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"11","text":"The estimated values in items 8 and 9 are provided for budgeting purposes only and do not oblige the Council to purchase any minimum volume of Services."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"9":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 9 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"2","text":"Term and extension"},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Term","text":"This Agreement starts on the Commencement Date and continues until the Expiry Date, unless it ends earlier under clause 30 or is extended under this clause 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Extension","text":"There is no right to extend the Term beyond the Expiry Date.","clauseRef":"Clause 2.2","extractionIds":["X-C-021-extensions"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"Re-procurement","text":"The Council shall decide before the notice date in clause 31.1 whether to procure a replacement for the Services."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"No implied extension","text":"Nothing in this Agreement entitles the Supplier to carry out Services, or to be paid for them, after the Expiry Date unless the parties agree a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.5","title":"Further contracts","text":"Any further contract for the Services shall be awarded in accordance with the Council's Contract Procedure Rules."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"16":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 16 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"12","text":"Invoicing and payment"},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.1","title":"Invoices","text":"The Supplier shall invoice the Council quarterly in arrears for Services properly performed."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.2","title":"Valid invoice","text":"A valid invoice shall quote the Council's purchase order number and the contract reference C-021, and shall be addressed to the Council's Accounts Payable team."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.3","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT. The Council shall pay VAT at the rate in force on receipt of a valid VAT invoice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.4","title":"Payment","text":"The Council shall pay each undisputed invoice within 30 days of receipt.","clauseRef":"Clause 12.4","extractionIds":["X-C-021-paymentTerms"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.5","title":"Late payment","text":"Interest on late payment accrues under the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1998."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"27":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 27 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"30","text":"Termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.1","title":"Termination for convenience","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement for convenience at any time by giving the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice.","clauseRef":"Clause 30.1","extractionIds":["X-C-021-terminationForConvenience"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.2","title":"Termination for breach","text":"Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice if the other commits a material breach that is not remedied within thirty (30) days of a notice requiring it to be remedied."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.3","title":"Insolvency","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement immediately by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Sums payable","text":"Where the Council terminates under clause 30.1, the only sums payable are those set out in clause 33.2."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"28":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 28 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"31","text":"Expiry, renewal and notice"},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.1","title":"Expiry and renewal","text":"The Council shall give the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice before the end of the Initial Term if it wishes to exercise an extension option or to let this Agreement expire.","clauseRef":"Clause 31.1","extractionIds":["X-C-021-noticePeriod","X-C-021-autoRenewal"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.2","title":"Serving notice","text":"Notice under clause 31.1 must be in writing and given in accordance with clause 45 (Notices)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.3","title":"Expiry without notice","text":"If the Council gives no notice, this Agreement expires on the Expiry Date and the Supplier has no right to payment for Services after that date unless a Variation has been agreed under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.4","title":"Last date for notice","text":"For the Initial Term, the last date on which the Council may give notice under clause 31.1 is 30 September 2029."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.5","title":"Withdrawing a notice","text":"The Council may withdraw a notice to extend only with the Supplier's written agreement."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"29":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 29 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"33","text":"Consequences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"No termination payment is due from the Council except for Charges properly incurred up to the termination date.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-021-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"39":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 39 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Standard rate per hour £42.00; Senior rate per hour £68.00; Out-of-hours call-out per call £145.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-021-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are fixed for the Initial Term."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"42":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 42 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges are fixed for the Initial Term and are not subject to indexation.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-021-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Requests to change","text":"Any request to change the Charges during the Initial Term must follow clause 41 (Variation)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No change for the Supplier's costs","text":"Nothing in this Schedule 4 permits an increase because of changes in the Supplier's own costs, including labour, plant, materials and fuel."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}],"47":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Insurance brokerage: agreement | Page 47 of 78"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"No service credit regime applies under this Agreement.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-021-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Other remedies","text":"The Council's remedies for poor performance are set out in clause 22 (Performance management)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-021 | Ashdene Risk Partners Ltd"}]}},"DOC-C-022":{"id":"DOC-C-022","contractId":"C-022","title":"Adult day services: agreement","pageCount":54,"isIllustrative":true,"pages":{"4":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 4 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contract Particulars"},{"kind":"item","num":"1","text":"Contracting Authority: Marchbank Borough Council."},{"kind":"item","num":"2","text":"Supplier: Pennard Community Care CIC, company number 90012877."},{"kind":"item","num":"3","text":"Services: Adult day services."},{"kind":"item","num":"4","text":"Commencement Date: 1 January 2025.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 4","extractionIds":["X-C-022-startDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"5","text":"Expiry Date of the Initial Term: 31 December 2029.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 5","extractionIds":["X-C-022-endDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"6","text":"Procurement route: Light-touch regime."},{"kind":"item","num":"7","text":"Governing law: the law of England and Wales."},{"kind":"item","num":"8","text":"Estimated annual value of the Services: £1,600,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 8","extractionIds":["X-C-022-estimatedAnnualValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"9","text":"Estimated total value over the Initial Term: £8,000,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 9","extractionIds":["X-C-022-awardedTotalValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"10","text":"Maximum Contract Value: see clause 14.3. The estimated values in items 8 and 9 are provided for budgeting purposes only and do not oblige the Council to purchase any minimum volume of Services."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"10":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 10 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"2","text":"Term and extension"},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Term","text":"This Agreement starts on the Commencement Date and continues until the Expiry Date, unless it ends earlier under clause 30 or is extended under this clause 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Extension","text":"The Council may, by giving the Supplier written notice, extend the Term on 1 occasion by up to 24 months each time (each an Extension Period).","clauseRef":"Clause 2.2","extractionIds":["X-C-022-extensions"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"Terms of an extension","text":"Each Extension Period is on the terms of this Agreement. The Charges for an Extension Period are reviewed only in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Decision","text":"The decision to extend is the Council's alone. The Supplier may not refuse an extension that the Council has validly exercised."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.5","title":"Longest possible Term","text":"The Term, including every Extension Period, cannot run beyond 31 December 2031."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.6","title":"Interpretation","text":"References to the Term include any Extension Period."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"17":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 17 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"12","text":"Invoicing and payment"},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.1","title":"Invoices","text":"The Supplier shall invoice the Council monthly in arrears for Services properly performed."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.2","title":"Valid invoice","text":"A valid invoice shall quote the Council's purchase order number and the contract reference C-022, and shall be addressed to the Council's Accounts Payable team."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.3","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT. The Council shall pay VAT at the rate in force on receipt of a valid VAT invoice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.4","title":"Payment","text":"The Council shall pay each undisputed invoice within 28 days of receipt.","clauseRef":"Clause 12.4","extractionIds":["X-C-022-paymentTerms"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.5","title":"Late payment","text":"Interest on late payment accrues under the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1998."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.6","title":"Disputed invoices","text":"If the Council disputes part of an invoice it shall pay the undisputed part and tell the Supplier within ten (10) days why it disputes the rest."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"20":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 20 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"14","text":"Charges and Maximum Contract Value"},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.1","title":"Charges","text":"The Council shall pay the Charges set out in Schedule 2 for Services properly performed in accordance with this Agreement."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.2","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT and are the only sums payable by the Council for the Services."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.3","title":"Maximum Contract Value","text":"The Council's liability to pay the Charges under this Agreement shall not exceed £8,800,000 in aggregate (the Maximum Contract Value) unless increased by a Variation under clause 41.","clauseRef":"Clause 14.3","extractionIds":["X-C-022-maximumValue"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.4","title":"Alert at 80%","text":"The Supplier shall notify the Council in writing when cumulative Charges reach eighty per cent (80%) of the Maximum Contract Value, being £7,040,000."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.5","title":"Services beyond the limit","text":"The Supplier shall not be obliged to perform Services that would cause the Maximum Contract Value to be exceeded unless a Variation has been agreed in writing under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"14.6","title":"No minimum commitment","text":"The Council is not obliged to purchase any minimum volume of Services, and the estimated values in the Contract Particulars do not create a minimum commitment."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"28":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 28 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"30","text":"Termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.1","title":"Termination for convenience","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement for convenience at any time by giving the Supplier not less than three (3) months' written notice.","clauseRef":"Clause 30.1","extractionIds":["X-C-022-terminationForConvenience"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.2","title":"Termination for breach","text":"Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice if the other commits a material breach that is not remedied within thirty (30) days of a notice requiring it to be remedied."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.3","title":"Insolvency","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement immediately by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Sums payable","text":"Where the Council terminates under clause 30.1, the only sums payable are those set out in clause 33.2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.6","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination does not affect any right that has accrued before the termination date."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"29":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 29 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"31","text":"Expiry, renewal and notice"},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.1","title":"Expiry and renewal","text":"The Council shall give the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice before the end of the Initial Term if it wishes to exercise an extension option or to let this Agreement expire.","clauseRef":"Clause 31.1","extractionIds":["X-C-022-noticePeriod","X-C-022-autoRenewal"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.2","title":"Serving notice","text":"Notice under clause 31.1 must be in writing and given in accordance with clause 45 (Notices)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.3","title":"Expiry without notice","text":"If the Council gives no notice, this Agreement expires on the Expiry Date and the Supplier has no right to payment for Services after that date unless a Variation has been agreed under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.4","title":"Last date for notice","text":"For the Initial Term, the last date on which the Council may give notice under clause 31.1 is 30 June 2029."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.5","title":"Withdrawing a notice","text":"The Council may withdraw a notice to extend only with the Supplier's written agreement."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.6","title":"Register","text":"The Council shall record the last date for notice in its contracts register."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"30":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 30 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"33","text":"Consequences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"No termination payment is due from the Council except for Charges properly incurred up to the termination date.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-022-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.6","title":"Staff","text":"Where staff transfer on exit, the parties shall comply with the provisions in Schedule 10 (Staff transfer)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"40":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 40 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Standard care visit per hour £24.60; Evening and weekend per hour £28.90; Night sleep-in per night £118.00.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-022-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are reviewed once a year in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"clause","num":"5","title":"Travel","text":"The Council shall not be charged for travel time or mobilisation unless Table 1 says so."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"43":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 43 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges shall be reviewed on 1 January each year by reference to the Consumer Prices Index (CPI) for the preceding September, provided that no increase shall exceed 3.0% in any Contract Year.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-022-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Evidence","text":"The Supplier shall send the Council the index figures it has used, with its calculation, at least thirty (30) days before the review date."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No retrospective increase","text":"A change takes effect from the review date only and does not apply retrospectively."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Cap applies","text":"If the index figure is higher than the limit in paragraph 2.1, the limit applies."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}],"48":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Adult day services: agreement | Page 48 of 54"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"If the Supplier fails to meet a Key Performance Indicator in a month, the Council may deduct a Service Credit of 2% of the monthly Charges for each failure, up to a maximum of 10% of the monthly Charges.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-022-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Not a penalty","text":"Service Credits are a price adjustment that reflects the reduced value of the Services. They are not a penalty."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.3","title":"Deduction","text":"Service Credits shall be deducted from the next invoice, or paid by the Supplier within thirty (30) days if no further invoice is due."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-022 | Pennard Community Care CIC"}]}},"DOC-C-023":{"id":"DOC-C-023","contractId":"C-023","title":"Telecare and community alarm service: agreement","pageCount":58,"isIllustrative":true,"pages":{"5":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and community alarm service: agreement | Page 5 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contract Particulars"},{"kind":"item","num":"1","text":"Contracting Authority: Marchbank Borough Council."},{"kind":"item","num":"2","text":"Supplier: Eastmoor Telecare Ltd, company number 90013014."},{"kind":"item","num":"3","text":"Services: Telecare and community alarm service."},{"kind":"item","num":"4","text":"Commencement Date: 1 November 2023.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 4","extractionIds":["X-C-023-startDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"5","text":"Expiry Date of the Initial Term: 31 October 2028.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 5","extractionIds":["X-C-023-endDate"]},{"kind":"item","num":"6","text":"Procurement route: Open procedure."},{"kind":"item","num":"7","text":"Governing law: the law of England and Wales."},{"kind":"item","num":"8","text":"Estimated annual value of the Services: £740,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 8","extractionIds":["X-C-023-estimatedAnnualValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"9","text":"Estimated total value over the Initial Term: £3,700,000 (excluding VAT).","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 9","extractionIds":["X-C-023-awardedTotalValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"10","text":"No maximum contract value is stated. The estimated total value above is the only value limit in the Agreement.","clauseRef":"Contract Particulars, item 10","extractionIds":["X-C-023-maximumValue"]},{"kind":"item","num":"11","text":"The estimated values in items 8 and 9 are provided for budgeting purposes only and do not oblige the Council to purchase any minimum volume of Services."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-023 | Eastmoor Telecare Ltd"}],"11":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and community alarm service: agreement | Page 11 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"2","text":"Term and extension"},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Term","text":"This Agreement starts on the Commencement Date and continues until the Expiry Date, unless it ends earlier under clause 30 or is extended under this clause 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Extension","text":"The Council may, by giving the Supplier written notice, extend the Term on 1 occasion by up to 12 months each time (each an Extension Period).","clauseRef":"Clause 2.2","extractionIds":["X-C-023-extensions"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"Terms of an extension","text":"Each Extension Period is on the terms of this Agreement. The Charges for an Extension Period are reviewed only in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Decision","text":"The decision to extend is the Council's alone. The Supplier may not refuse an extension that the Council has validly exercised."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.5","title":"Longest possible Term","text":"The Term, including every Extension Period, cannot run beyond 31 October 2029."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-023 | Eastmoor Telecare Ltd"}],"18":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and community alarm service: agreement | Page 18 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"12","text":"Invoicing and payment"},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.1","title":"Invoices","text":"The Supplier shall invoice the Council monthly in arrears for Services properly performed."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.2","title":"Valid invoice","text":"A valid invoice shall quote the Council's purchase order number and the contract reference C-023, and shall be addressed to the Council's Accounts Payable team."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.3","title":"VAT","text":"The Charges are exclusive of VAT. The Council shall pay VAT at the rate in force on receipt of a valid VAT invoice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.4","title":"Payment","text":"The Council shall pay each undisputed invoice within 30 days of receipt.","clauseRef":"Clause 12.4","extractionIds":["X-C-023-paymentTerms"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"12.5","title":"Late payment","text":"Interest on late payment accrues under the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1998."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-023 | Eastmoor Telecare Ltd"}],"29":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and community alarm service: agreement | Page 29 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"30","text":"Termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.1","title":"Termination for convenience","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement for convenience at any time by giving the Supplier not less than three (3) months' written notice.","clauseRef":"Clause 30.1","extractionIds":["X-C-023-terminationForConvenience"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.2","title":"Termination for breach","text":"Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice if the other commits a material breach that is not remedied within thirty (30) days of a notice requiring it to be remedied."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.3","title":"Insolvency","text":"The Council may terminate this Agreement immediately by written notice if the Supplier becomes insolvent or ceases to carry on business."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.4","title":"Required by law","text":"The Council may also terminate this Agreement by written notice if it is required to do so by law."},{"kind":"clause","num":"30.5","title":"Sums payable","text":"Where the Council terminates under clause 30.1, the only sums payable are those set out in clause 33.2."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-023 | Eastmoor Telecare Ltd"}],"30":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and community alarm service: agreement | Page 30 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"31","text":"Expiry, renewal and notice"},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.1","title":"Expiry and renewal","text":"The Council shall give the Supplier not less than six (6) months' written notice before the end of the Initial Term if it wishes to exercise an extension option or to let this Agreement expire.","clauseRef":"Clause 31.1","extractionIds":["X-C-023-noticePeriod","X-C-023-autoRenewal"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.2","title":"Serving notice","text":"Notice under clause 31.1 must be in writing and given in accordance with clause 45 (Notices)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.3","title":"Expiry without notice","text":"If the Council gives no notice, this Agreement expires on the Expiry Date and the Supplier has no right to payment for Services after that date unless a Variation has been agreed under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.4","title":"Last date for notice","text":"For the Initial Term, the last date on which the Council may give notice under clause 31.1 is 30 April 2028."},{"kind":"clause","num":"31.5","title":"Withdrawing a notice","text":"The Council may withdraw a notice to extend only with the Supplier's written agreement."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-023 | Eastmoor Telecare Ltd"}],"31":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and community alarm service: agreement | Page 31 of 58"},{"kind":"heading","num":"33","text":"Consequences of termination"},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.1","title":"Accrued rights","text":"Termination or expiry does not affect any right or liability that accrued before the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.2","title":"Payments on termination","text":"No termination payment is due from the Council except for Charges properly incurred up to the termination date.","clauseRef":"Clause 33.2","extractionIds":["X-C-023-exitFees"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.3","title":"Exit assistance","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-023 | Eastmoor Telecare Ltd"}],"41":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Telecare and 