e","text":"On expiry or termination the Supplier shall give the Council the exit assistance described in Schedule 9 (Exit management)."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.4","title":"Return of property","text":"The Supplier shall return all Council data and property within thirty (30) days of the date of termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.5","title":"Survival","text":"Clauses 11 (Confidentiality), 33 and 44 (Governing law) survive termination or expiry."},{"kind":"clause","num":"33.6","title":"Staff","text":"Where staff transfer on exit, the parties shall comply with the provisions in Schedule 10 (Staff transfer)."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-024 | Halvorsen Contact Solutions Ltd"}],"42":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Contact centre telephony: agreement | Page 42 of 62"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 3","text":"Schedule of rates"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1","title":"Application","text":"The rates in Table 1 apply to Services ordered during the Initial Term and any Extension Period."},{"kind":"clause","num":"Table 1","title":"Rates","text":"Schedule of rates: Service desk analyst per day £310.00; Engineer per day £480.00; Licence per user per month £14.20.","clauseRef":"Schedule 3, Table 1","extractionIds":["X-C-024-rateCard"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2","title":"VAT","text":"All rates are exclusive of VAT."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3","title":"Review of rates","text":"The rates are reviewed once a year in accordance with Schedule 4."},{"kind":"clause","num":"4","title":"Additional work","text":"Work that is not covered by Table 1 shall be priced pro rata from the nearest equivalent rate and agreed in writing before the work starts."},{"kind":"clause","num":"5","title":"Travel","text":"The Council shall not be charged for travel time or mobilisation unless Table 1 says so."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-024 | Halvorsen Contact Solutions Ltd"}],"45":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Contact centre telephony: agreement | Page 45 of 62"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 4","text":"Price review"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Starting Charges","text":"The Charges at the Commencement Date are set out in Schedule 2."},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.2","title":"Changes","text":"The Charges may be changed only under this Schedule 4 or by a Variation under clause 41."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Annual review","text":"The Charges shall be reviewed on 1 February each year by reference to the Consumer Prices Index (CPI) for the preceding September, provided that no increase shall exceed 3.0% in any Contract Year.","clauseRef":"Schedule 4, paragraph 2.1","extractionIds":["X-C-024-indexation"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Evidence","text":"The Supplier shall send the Council the index figures it has used, with its calculation, at least thirty (30) days before the review date."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.3","title":"No retrospective increase","text":"A change takes effect from the review date only and does not apply retrospectively."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.4","title":"Cap applies","text":"If the index figure is higher than the limit in paragraph 2.1, the limit applies."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-024 | Halvorsen Contact Solutions Ltd"}],"50":[{"kind":"header","text":"Marchbank Borough Council | Contact centre telephony: agreement | Page 50 of 62"},{"kind":"heading","num":"Schedule 6","text":"Performance and service credits"},{"kind":"clause","num":"1.1","title":"Performance standards","text":"The Supplier shall meet the Key Performance Indicators set out in Annex A to this Schedule."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.1","title":"Reporting","text":"The Supplier shall give the Council a performance report by the fifth (5th) Working Day of each month."},{"kind":"clause","num":"2.2","title":"Audit","text":"The Council may audit the performance data on reasonable notice."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.1","title":"Service Credits","text":"If the Supplier fails to meet a Key Performance Indicator in a month, the Council may deduct a Service Credit of 2% of the monthly Charges for each failure, up to a maximum of 10% of the monthly Charges.","clauseRef":"Schedule 6, paragraph 3.1","extractionIds":["X-C-024-serviceCredits"]},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.2","title":"Not a penalty","text":"Service Credits are a price adjustment that reflects the reduced value of the Services. They are not a penalty."},{"kind":"clause","num":"3.3","title":"Deduction","text":"Service Credits shall be deducted from the next invoice, or paid by the Supplier within thirty (30) days if no further invoice is due."},{"kind":"footer","text":"Execution version | Contract ref C-024 | Halvorsen Contact Solutions Ltd"}]}}},"payments":[{"date":"2022-04-08","supplierNameRaw":"Bellmere Building Supplies Ltd","department":"Housing","expenseType":"Materials","purpose":"Materials","amountGBP":20557.1,"vatIrrecoverableGBP":0,"id":"MBC-2022-000001","sourceFile":"marchbank-payments-over-500-2022-04.csv"},{"date":"2022-04-09","supplierNameRaw":"Quillon Environmental","department":"Waste and recycling","expenseType":"Waste and recycling","purpose":"Waste collection and recycling","amountGBP":500050.55,"vatIrrecoverableGBP":0,"id":"MBC-2022-000002","sourceFile":"marchbank-payments-over-500-2022-04.csv"},{"date":"2022-04-11","supplierNameRaw":"Veridene Parking Services Ltd","department":"Parking and traffic","expenseType":"Parking and traffic","purpose":"Parking enforcement services","amountGBP":82366.56,"vatIrrecoverableGBP":0,"id":"MBC-2022-000003","sourceFile":"marchbank-payments-over-500-2022-04.csv"},{"date":"2022-04-12","supplierNameRaw":"Skerrow Temporary Accommodation Ltd","department":"Housing","expenseType":"Temporary accommodation","purpose":"Temporary accommodation","amountGBP":22691.44,"vatIrrecoverableGBP":0,"id":"MBC-2022-000004","sourceFile":"marchbank-payments-over-500-2